<title>POLAND: Poland raises October T-bill offer to PLN 3.8 bln.</title>
<headline>Poland raises October T-bill offer to PLN 3.8 bln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish finance ministry raised its monthly T-bill offer for October to 3.8 billion zlotys from 3.15 billion in September.</p>
<p>The ministry will not offer its 39-week paper in October.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
